    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Brady are delighted to bring to the market this Grade A modern office space in Drogheda town centre. The offices are located on the third floor of the MTI building on Drogheda's north side. The location is well served by amenities with banks, restaurants, cafés and shops within the surrounding area. In addition, the property benefits from being close to public transport facilities with 20 minute walk to the the train station and a 10 minute walk to Drogheda bus station. The property extends to an internal floor area of approximately 143 m2 and briefly comprises third floor Grade A offices currently furnished and fitted out to a very high specification and offering a large floor plate to provide for open plan and cellular offices, canteen and toilets."
      }
